#: toplevel.cpp:58
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu dastur kompyuterdagi no-KDE dasturlarini qidiradi va ularni KDE "
"menyusiga qoʻshadi. Boshlash uchun Qidirish tugmasini bosing va natijalardan "
"istagan dasturni tanlab Qoʻllash tugasini bosing."

